{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ReKG1bcZtsvebWfo9ZrA3y","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## i18n Catalog Report\n\n**File:** `/home/pete/cadres/lattice/extension/src/review/i18n/en.json` | **Lines:** 737 | **Format:** JSON nested objects\n\n### 1. Top-Level Namespaces\n\n**Present (14/14 expected):**\n- reviewPanel ✓\n- reviewStatus ✓\n- reviewActions ✓\n- promotionQueue ✓\n- contradictionQueue ✓\n- proposalDialog ✓\n- memoryInbox ✓\n- staleView ✓\n- evidenceInspector ✓\n- eventTraceView ✓\n- retrievalExplanationView ✓\n- consolidationQueueView ✓\n- indexingHealthView ✓\n- workspaceGraphHealthView ✓\n\n**Additionally present:**\n- reviewOverview (summary/status view)\n\n**Missing:** None. All 14 required namespaces present.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Per-Namespace Key Inventory & UX Coverage\n\n**reviewPanel** (50 keys): title, subtitle, refresh, retry, loading, empty, error, overview, overviewDescription, routePlaceholder, routeUnavailable, capabilityDirect, capabilityComposed, capabilityUnavailable, summaryIndexing/Memories/Metrics/Graph, statusReady/Indexing/Error/Unknown, route (12 subroutes), description (12 subdescs). **Coverage:** Panel title, routing labels, descriptions, status indicators. No loading/empty state repetition needed here (delegated to views).\n\n**reviewStatus** (16 keys): verified, unverified, in_review, stale, contradicted, superseded, expired, invalidated, pending, applied, rejected, queued, running, proposed, failed, dropped. **Coverage:** Reusable status badge labels.\n\n**reviewActions** (2 keys): accept, reject. **Coverage:** Basic action set; extended per-view.\n\n**promotionQueue** (8 keys): description, empty, columns (8: proposedClass, currentScope, targetScope, confidence, evidenceCount, createdAt, status, actions), actions (3: review, accept, reject), messages (2: applySuccess, rejectSuccess). **Coverage:** Columns, empty state, success messages. Missing: loading state.\n\n**contradictionQueue** (8 keys): description, empty, columns (7: memoryA/B, linkType, detectedBy, createdAt, status, actions), actions (3: review, accept, reject), messages (2). **Coverage:** Good; parallel to promotionQueue.\n\n**proposalDialog** (30 keys): close, cancel, accept, reject, summaryTitle, evidenceTitle, provenanceTitle, diffTitle, before/after, proposalKind, status, proposedClass/currentScope/targetScope/confidence/evidenceCount/createdAt, expectedEffect, model/promptHash/responseHash/promptTokens/responseTokens/latencyMs/calledAt, noEvidence, noProvenance, rejectReasonLabel/Help/Placeholder, typedConfirmPrompt, genericError, promotionTitle, contradictionTitle, promotionEffect, supersedeEffect, invalidateEffect. **Coverage:** Complete modal dialog; all actions, metadata fields, error/empty states.\n\n**memoryInbox** (26 keys): tableLabel, emptyTitle, emptyInitial, emptyFiltered, error, errorBanner, loadingHint, lastVerifiedNever, noContent, pageSizeLabel, sortDirection, columns (7), actions (3), pagination (4), filters (status/scope/memoryClass with title/placeholder/button/summary/detail), scope (5), class (12). **Coverage:** Table, pagination, filters, empty/error states; **comprehensive**.\n\n**staleView** (40 keys): title, loadingHint, errorTitle, filterStatus/Scope, filterStatusPlaceholder/ScopePlaceholder, activeStatus/Scope, scopeCount, allStatuses, allScopes, inspectEvidence, reverify, reverifyLoading, verifySuccess, empty, emptyFiltered, notAvailable, column (7), scope (4), class (12), statusReason (5), reason (10). **Coverage:** Full stale memory list view; filter UI, re-verify action, reason explanations.\n\n**evidenceInspector** (20 keys): title, subtitle, selectPrompt, errorTitle, openTrace, openReference, reverify, reverifyLoading, verifySuccess, referenceResolveError, memoryId, memoryClass, scope, status, confidence, confidenceReason, lastVerifiedAt, lastVerificationResult, contentPanel, evidenceList, provenanceList, eventHistory, linkList, verificationPanel, linkReason, linkStrength, notAvailable, noEvidence, noProvenance, noEvents, noLinks, noVerificationChecks. **Coverage:** Deep inspection panels; reference navigation, empty states for each section.\n\n**eventTraceView** (48 keys): title, subtitle, selectPrompt, errorTitle, notAvailable, empty, emptyFiltered, openPayload, openRetrievalExplanation, payloadDialogTitle, copyPayload, openInEditor, closeDialog, noPayload, copyPayloadSuccess/Error, openPayloadError, openMemoryReference, openFileReference, invalidSince/Until/Window, columns (9), pagination (4), filters (kindButton/actorButton/sessionButton/taskButton/workspaceButton/branchButton with Title/Placeholder variants, since/until/isoPlaceholder, applyWindow/clearWindow, active display variants), scope (3), actor (4), kind (22). **Coverage:** Comprehensive trace viewer; time filtering, multiple event kinds, filter summaries, payload access.\n\n**retrievalExplanationView** (28 keys): title, subtitle, selectPrompt, errorTitle, unsupportedTitle, empty, noExcluded, noAnchors, notAvailable, anchorsTitle, excludedTitle, excludedReason, excludedScore, fullSignalsTitle, columns (6), pagination (4), request (4: toolName/intent/timestamp/requestId/taskStatement), decision (3: included/excluded/expanded), source (9: exact_path_symbol_lookup, code_graph_traversal, doc_backlinks_outgoing_links, fts, embeddings, event_similarity, memory_links, workflow_similarity, recent_active_working_memory), signal (13). **Coverage:** Retrieval debugging view; decision types, evidence sources, scoring signals.\n\n**consolidationQueueView** (39 keys): title, subtitle, tableLabel, errorTitle, empty, emptyFiltered, notAvailable, retryMissingSession, retryConfirm, retrySuccess, durationMs, durationSeconds, columns (9), queue (4: currentDepth/maxDepth/droppedCount/visibleJobs, droppedTitle/Message), actions (6), pagination (4), filters (all, statusButton/kindButton/modeButton with active/Title/Placeholder variants), status (7),