debugging view; decision types, evidence sources, scoring signals.\n\n**consolidationQueueView** (39 keys): title, subtitle, tableLabel, errorTitle, empty, emptyFiltered, notAvailable, retryMissingSession, retryConfirm, retrySuccess, durationMs, durationSeconds, columns (9), queue (4: currentDepth/maxDepth/droppedCount/visibleJobs, droppedTitle/Message), actions (6), pagination (4), filters (all, statusButton/kindButton/modeButton with active/Title/Placeholder variants), status (7), kind (8), mode (5). **Coverage:** Job queue table; retry actions, queue pressure metrics, job filtering.\n\n**indexingHealthView** (29 keys): title, subtitle, errorTitle, empty, notReported, notesTitle, actions (2: refresh, refreshing), summary (4: status/nodes/edges/files), status (2: indexing/ready), watcher (2: indexing/watching), sections (4: pipeline/vector/fts/eventLog), pipeline (6 keys including tableLabel, watcherStatus, lastFullRescan, language/parsed/failed/lastError), vector (4: totalEmbeddings, lastRebuild, averageFreshness, staleEmbeddings), fts (5: lastRebuild, orphanRows, tableLabel, tableName, rowCount, notes), eventLog (5: lastHour/last24Hours/last7Days/lastCompaction/spilloverRows). **Coverage:** Operational health dashboard; status states, subsystem breakdowns, metrics display.\n\n**workspaceGraphHealthView** (27 keys): title, subtitle, errorTitle, notesTitle, notReported, summary (4: nodes/edges/files/languages), sections (5: nodeFamilies/edgeFamilies/brokenReferences/staleEdges/orphanSymbols), actions (4: refresh/recompute/refreshing/inspect), columns (6), nodes/edges/brokenReferences/staleEdges/orphanSymbols (each with tableLabel and conditional empty), pagination (4). **Coverage:** Graph integrity dashboard; family breakdowns, reference health, pagination.\n\n**reviewOverview** (9 keys): daemonStatus, memoryCount, signalCount, nodeCount, fileCount, edgeCount, languages, none, unknown, routeSupport. **Coverage:** Summary card display.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Interpolation