{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YL1bW3bEAsvfd93Vq2Fj4H","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile the audit report:\n\n## R78 Mutation Handler Error Handling Audit\n\n**Silent catch patterns found:** Zero (.catch() antipatterns clean across review/ tree)\n\n### File-by-file mutation handler findings:\n\n**extension/src/review/components/ProposalDialog.ts**\n- Reject handler (lines 158-172): WRAPPED in try/catch with error banner + `setError()` for inline state display ✓\n- Accept handler (lines 174-184): WRAPPED in try/catch with error banner + `setError()` for inline state display ✓\n\n**extension/src/review/promotionQueue.ts**\n- Initial load (lines 29-40): WRAPPED in try/catch; calls `reportReviewViewError()` for error reporting ✓\n- Accept/reject onApply/onReject (lines 186-193): NO direct wrapping. These are passed as callbacks to `openProposalDialog()` which handles try/catch in the ProposalDialog component itself. Error handling delegated to dialog. ✓\n\n**extension/src/review/contradictionQueue.ts**\n- Initial load (lines 30-41): WRAPPED in try/catch; calls `reportReviewViewError()` ✓\n- Accept/reject handlers (lines 232-251): NO direct wrapping in contradictionQueue.ts—callbacks delegated to ProposalDialog which wraps them. ✓\n\n**extension/src/review/staleView.ts**\n- mountStaleView load (lines 39-55): WRAPPED in try/catch; calls `host.reportError?.()` and renders error state ✓\n- reverifyStaleMemory handler in reviewPanel.ts (lines 754-779): WRAPPED in try/catch with dual error paths: inline row error state (`rowErrors[memoryId]`) AND `vscode.window.showErrorMessage()` ✓\n\n**extension/src/review/evidenceInspector.ts**\n- mountEvidenceInspector load (lines 33-46): WRAPPED in try/catch; calls `host.reportError?.()` and renders error state ✓\n- reverifyInspectorMemory handler in reviewPanel.ts (lines 781-806): WRAPPED in try/catch with dual