\n- **F-7 (minor, testid convention):** `memoryInbox` filter testid uses `memory-inbox-filter-{key}` instead of `review-memory-inbox-filter-{key}`. Captured in `T-followup-R78-C`.\n- **F-8 (minor, i18n future-proofing):** i18n helper supports `{name}` placeholders only, not ICU plural rules. Single-locale English today; impact deferred. Captured in `T-followup-R78-C`.\n- **F-10 (minor, single-source-of-truth):** `escapeHtml` is redefined in nine modules; coding standard threshold for extraction is two. Captured in `T-followup-R78-C`.\n\nPer the R78 task definition-of-done and the global execution philosophy, all findings are opened as follow-up tasks in this build (not deferred to a future session).\n\n## Final status\n\n**Complete.** Review verdict is **PASS-WITH-FOLLOWUP-TASKS T-followup-R78-A, T-followup-R78-B, T-followup-R78-C**. The review document is ready for downstream tasks R79 (contract gate) and R88 (definition-of-done gate) to consume.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":150247,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1210},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f5c8929-5870-493f-9d77-6b17226dfdaa","uuid":"70bd8743-5708-4015-b369-a94851c69030","request_id":"req_011Cb8cXW5AJcdRK9YHG4j5N"}
